  "description": "Codex: Adeptus Custodes (11e) Guardians of the Throne — MARTIAL MASTERY (WP-C46): when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit is selected to fight, its melee attacks have [SUSTAINED HITS 1] or [LETHAL HITS] (a free choice, offered as a 0-CP rule card in the unit_selected_to_fight window). Fixture cus11e_c3_custodes_active (P1 Custodes, Guardians of the Throne). Fight phase: both Pile In halves passed, a real click selects the Blade Champion (engaged with the Deff Dread) to fight; the StratagemDialog shows the MARTIAL MASTERY card with its two option buttons; a real click on [LETHAL HITS]; no CP spent; attacks assigned to the Deff Dread and resolved: the melee hit roll carries [LETHAL HITS] (the Blade Champion's vaultswords have none of their own). Setup privileges: CP 0 for both players (no paid stratagem competes), auto wound allocation.",
